# Cortex IDE — Project Rules

## Stack
- Next.js 16 + React 19, App Router (`src/app/`)
- TypeScript strict mode
- Tauri v2 desktop shell (Rust sidecar)
- SQLite via Drizzle ORM (better-sqlite3, WAL mode)
- No Tailwind — all styles are **inline React styles**
- No `ai` SDK — direct fetch to our own `/api/v2/proxy/llm` route

## Styling Rules
- **Inline styles only** — no CSS classes, no Tailwind, no CSS modules
- Use **longhand properties** (not shorthand): `paddingTop`, `paddingLeft` — not `padding: "8px 16px"`
- React 19 warns on mixed shorthand/longhand — always use longhand
- Colors: glass/frost theme — `rgba()` backgrounds, `backdrop-filter: blur()`
- Brand: clear glass, super light blue + bright red accents
- Green for additions, blue for deletions (not traditional red)
- Diffs: dark background `rgba(15,23,42,0.95)`, monospace font
- Touch targets: 44px minimum (Apple HIG)
- Border radius: 14px for cards, 8px for buttons, 12px for containers

## Architecture
- Three agent runtimes: OpenClaw, Codex, Claude Code — always build for all three
- `CortexClient` pattern: `LocalCortexClient` (exec), `CloudCortexClient` (HTTPS), `HybridCortexClient`
- API routes: all use `force-dynamic`, live in `src/app/api/v2/`
- Auth: JWT (jose, HS256, 30d), reads Bearer token OR httpOnly cookie
- Tools require approval via SSE `approval_required` event for mutations

## File Conventions
- Components: `src/components/desktop/` (desktop) or `src/components/mobile/` (mobile)
- Desktop chat and mobile chat are **completely separate codebases** — no shared components
- API routes: `src/app/api/v2/<feature>/route.ts`
- Libs: `src/lib/<domain>/` (e.g., `src/lib/llm/`, `src/lib/cortex/`, `src/lib/github/`)
- No barrel exports unless explicitly needed

## Code Style
- Markdown rendering only (no raw HTML injection)
- Mermaid: always `startOnLoad: false`
- Sanitize tab IDs: replace non-alphanumeric with `_` (path traversal prevention)
- Strip images/data URIs from persisted chat history
- Error handling: never throw in API routes — return structured errors
- Console logging: `[feature-name]` prefix (e.g., `[memory-recall]`, `[compaction]`)

## Git / Deployment
- Stay on `main` branch — no feature branches (rapid iteration mode)
- Commit messages: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `perf:`, `chore:`
- Never push to master
- Dev server: `http://localhost:3001`
- WebSocket: port 3002
